author Nradko <konrad.wierzbik@gmail.com> 1780500730 +0200
committer konrad-metric <konrad@metric.xyz> 1780501034 +0200

Add action-scoped pool reentrancy guard, inSwap view, and factory isPool check.

Important changes:
   - MetricReentrancyGuardTransient - transient lock stores per-function action id; revert when any guarded action is active
   - PoolActions - keccak256 action ids for addLiquidity, removeLiquidity, swap, simulateSwapAndRevert, and factory fee mutators
   - MetricOmmPool - swap to Metric guard; inSwap returns resolved price provider during live swap only
   - IMetricOmmPoolFactory isPool - view true when poolToIdx is non-zero for a registered deployment
   - tests - inSwap callback and nested-swap revert coverage; factory isPool registry test

Small changes:
    - simulateSwapAndRevert guarded and clears lock before SimulateSwap revert; PoolActions on all prior nonReentrant entrypoints; InSwapProbeCaller mock for swap callback probes
